{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55793","headline":"寄圭峯寂公 · 翁承赞","name":"寄圭峯寂公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屈指闲思癸丑年，共师曾听翠微泉。\n高梧疎冷月才上，古屋荒凉人未眠。\n别後青云虽寄迹，乱余白发欲垂肩。\n无端贫病莲峯下，一半乡心属暮蝉。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第七三六页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}